# The VSL master. `public/kalee/vsl.mp4` is a lossless `-c copy` remux of it
# (identical video and audio streams, only the moov atom moved), so the served
# file is the master for every practical purpose and committing both would
# carry 8.9 MB twice. Keep this file locally; nothing needs it to rebuild.
VSL_video.mp4
